Package: peacock
Title: Quick Project Initialization with Templates
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4190-7058"))
Description: Initialize project directory structures from pre-configured
    templates. Scaffolds for 'Shiny' applications, reproducible analyses,
    'Quarto' projects, 'Python' projects, and tool comparisons are created
    with one function call. Arbitrary 'GitHub' repositories can also serve
    as templates via a built-in registry.
